    "dataset_name": "UTMB Bedrest Campaign 1 Actigraphy",
    "dataset_catalog": "BRSMACT_Campaign_1_Actigraphy",
    "dataset_description": "This dataset contains data for all Campaign 1 subjects for the Bed Rest Standard Measure Actigraphy (BRSMAct) study. Sleep variables were measured using wrist actigraphy before bed rest, during bed rest, and post bed rest. Mean values of sleep latency, sleep duration, and sleep efficiency are provided for BR-2 through BR+6. The data generated by the actigraph were analyzed for the sleep-wake cycle, the quality of rest, and sleep to wake ratio. The Analyzed Data folder contains mean values for sleep latency, sleep duration, and sleep efficiency.",
